      "title": "Start here · setup + download",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "ausboss-nodes",
        "ver": "2.1.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "AUSBOSS_NODES_WorkflowNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"v\":1,\"title\":\"LaMa Object Removal\",\"subtitle\":\"Paint over an object and LaMa fills the hole from the surrounding scene. One small model, no prompt.\",\"author\":\"AusBoss\",\"layout\":\"card\",\"accent\":\"\",\"body\":\"## Start here\\nCopy `ausboss_pier_rowboat.png` from the pack's `example_workflows/inputs/` folder into `ComfyUI/input/`. Its alpha channel already holds a mask painted over the rowboat. Download **big-lama.pt** below into `ComfyUI/models/lama/`, refresh and queue. No prompt, no other packs, and it runs in seconds even on a CPU.\\n\\n## What happens\\n1. **Load Image** reads the picture, and its **MASK** output is the painted area. For your own image, right-click Load Image, open the mask editor and paint over what should go.\\n2. **Mask Refine** grows the mask by 8 px and softens its edge, so the fill also covers the outline and the reflection.\\n3. **Crop For Inpaint** cuts out the masked area with 2× context, and **LaMa Inpaint** fills it at native resolution.\\n4. **Stitch Inpaint** pastes the fill back with a 16 px feather; every pixel outside that blend stays untouched. **Compare** slides the result over the source, and **Save Image** writes the PNG with this workflow inside.\\n\\n## Try\\n- An outline of the object left behind? Raise **Expand** on Mask Refine.\\n- A smeared or repeated texture? Raise **Context** on Crop For Inpaint so LaMa sees more of the scene.\\n- LaMa removes; it does not add. To paint something new into the hole, see the Klein 9B Inpaint example.\",\"models\":[{\"name\":\"big-lama.pt\",\"dir\":\"lama\",\"size\":\"206 MB\",\"note\":\"LaMa inpainting checkpoint; ComfyUI/models/lama.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Sanster/models/releases/download/add_big_lama/big-lama.pt\"}],\"packs\":[],\"links\":[{\"label\":\"Sample image · ausboss_pier_rowboat.png\",\"url\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss/main/example_workflows/inputs/ausboss_pier_rowboat.png\"}]}",
        ""
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "note": "{\"v\":1,\"title\":\"LaMa Object Removal\",\"subtitle\":\"Paint over an object and LaMa fills the hole from the surrounding scene. One small model, no prompt.\",\"author\":\"AusBoss\",\"layout\":\"card\",\"accent\":\"\",\"body\":\"## Start here\\nCopy `ausboss_pier_rowboat.png` from the pack's `example_workflows/inputs/` folder into `ComfyUI/input/`. Its alpha channel already holds a mask painted over the rowboat. Download **big-lama.pt** below into `ComfyUI/models/lama/`, refresh and queue. No prompt, no other packs, and it runs in seconds even on a CPU.\\n\\n## What happens\\n1. **Load Image** reads the picture, and its **MASK** output is the painted area. For your own image, right-click Load Image, open the mask editor and paint over what should go.\\n2. **Mask Refine** grows the mask by 8 px and softens its edge, so the fill also covers the outline and the reflection.\\n3. **Crop For Inpaint** cuts out the masked area with 2× context, and **LaMa Inpaint** fills it at native resolution.\\n4. **Stitch Inpaint** pastes the fill back with a 16 px feather; every pixel outside that blend stays untouched. **Compare** slides the result over the source, and **Save Image** writes the PNG with this workflow inside.\\n\\n## Try\\n- An outline of the object left behind? Raise **Expand** on Mask Refine.\\n- A smeared or repeated texture? Raise **Context** on Crop For Inpaint so LaMa sees more of the scene.\\n- LaMa removes; it does not add. To paint something new into the hole, see the Klein 9B Inpaint example.\",\"models\":[{\"name\":\"big-lama.pt\",\"dir\":\"lama\",\"size\":\"206 MB\",\"note\":\"LaMa inpainting checkpoint; ComfyUI/models/lama.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Sanster/models/releases/download/add_big_lama/big-lama.pt\"}],\"packs\":[],\"links\":[{\"label\":\"Sample image · ausboss_pier_rowboat.png\",\"url\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss/main/example_workflows/inputs/ausboss_pier_rowboat.png\"}]}",
        "ausboss_workflow_note_panel": ""
      },
      "color": "#14424d",
      "bgcolor": "#161f21"
    },
